  "Summary": "",
  "TextID": 83709,
  "Text": "Whereas, On June 30, 2026, the Council of the City of New York (the “City Council”) adopted the expense budget for Fiscal Year 2027 with various programs and initiatives (the “Fiscal 2027 Expense Budget”); and\nWhereas, On June 30, 2025, the City Council adopted the expense budget for Fiscal Year 2026 with various programs and initiatives (the “Fiscal 2026 Expense Budget”); and\nWhereas, On June 30, 2024, the City Council adopted the expense budget for Fiscal Year 2025 with various programs and initiatives (the “Fiscal 2025 Expense Budget”); and\nWhereas, The City Council hereby implements and furthers the appropriations set forth in the Fiscal 2027, Fiscal 2026, and Fiscal 2025 Expense Budgets by approving the new designations and changes in the designation of certain organizations receiving discretionary funding; now, therefore, be it \nResolved, That the City Council approves the new designations and changes in the designation of certain organizations receiving discretionary funding pursuant to the Fiscal 2027, Fiscal 2026, and Fiscal 2025 Expense Budgets, as set forth in Charts 1 through 49.\n.",
  "RTF": "{\\rtf1\\fbidis\\ansi\\ansicpg1252\\deff0\\deflang1033\\deflangfe1033{\\fonttbl{\\f0\\froman\\fprq2\\fcharset0 Times New Roman;}{\\f1\\fswiss\\fprq2\\fcharset0 Calibri;}}\n{\\colortbl ;\\red0\\green0\\blue0;}\n\\viewkind4\\uc1\n\\pard\\ltrpar\\v0  \\f1\\par\n\\f0 By Council Member Lee\\f1\\par\n\\par\n\\pard\\ltrpar\\fi720\\sl480\\slmult1\\qj\\f0 Whereas, On June 30, 2026, the Council of the City of New York (the \\ldblquote City Council\\rdblquote ) adopted the expense budget for Fiscal Year 2027 with various programs and initiatives (the \\ldblquote Fiscal 2027 Expense Budget\\rdblquote ); and\\par\nWhereas, On June 30, 2025, the City Council adopted the expense budget for Fiscal Year 2026 with various programs and initiatives (the \\ldblquote Fiscal 2026 Expense Budget\\rdblquote ); and\\par\nWhereas, On June 30, 2024, the City Council adopted the expense budget for Fiscal Year 2025 with various programs and initiatives (the \\ldblquote Fiscal 2025 Expense Budget\\rdblquote ); and\\par\nWhereas, The City Council hereby implements and furthers the appropriations set forth in the Fiscal 2027, Fiscal 2026, and Fiscal 2025 Expense Budgets by approving the new designations and changes in the designation of certain organizations receiving discretionary funding; now, therefore, be it \\par\nResolved, That the City Council approves the new designations and changes in the designation of certain organizations receiving discretionary funding pursuant to the Fiscal 2027, Fiscal 2026, and Fiscal 2025 Expense Budgets, as set forth in Charts 1 through 49.\\par\n.\\par\n\\pard\\ltrpar\\sa160\\sl252\\slmult1\\cf0\\f1\\fs22\\par\n}\n",
